Hi3516 V100 data sheet (Chinese original) 5.6 APP_LOOP_EN (offset 0x27C, printed page 5-67, `Hi3516-Datasheet.txt` line 31833). Hi3516 V100 only (not in the Hi3516A, Hi3516A V200 and Hi3519 V101 data sheets).";

        field {
