        desc = "ERR_GIVEN_PKG_CNT is a count register for dropped packets caused by the frame tailors marked as errors.

Data sheet 5.7 ERR_GIVEN_PKG_CNT (offset 0x280, printed page 5-55, `Hi3516AV200-Datasheet.txt` line 32901).
Hi3516 V100 data sheet (Chinese original) 5.6 ERR_GIVEN_PKG_CNT (offset 0x280, printed page 5-68, `Hi3516-Datasheet.txt` line 31876).";

