    reg {
        name = "Count register for dropped packets caused by the frame types not listed in the filter list";
        desc = "ERR_FRM_TYPE_CNT is a count register for dropped packets caused by the frame types not listed in the filter list.

Data sheet 5.7 ERR_FRM_TYPE_CNT (offset 0x288, printed page 5-56, `Hi3516AV200-Datasheet.txt` line 32949).
Hi3516 V100 data sheet (Chinese original) 5.6 ERR_FRM_TYPE_CNT (offset 0x288, printed page 5-68, `Hi3516-Datasheet.txt` line 31895).";

        field {
            name = "err_frm_type_cnt";
            desc = "Count of dropped packets caused by the frame types not listed in the filter list";
            sw = r;
