Data sheet 5.7 CRF_CTRL_0_TYPE (offset 0x348, printed page 5-61, `Hi3516AV200-Datasheet.txt` line 33220).
Hi3516 V100 data sheet (Chinese original) 5.6 CRF_CTRL_0_TYPE (offset 0x348, printed page 5-75, `Hi3516-Datasheet.txt` line 32329).";

        field {
