    reg {
        name = "PMU raw interrupt enable register";
        desc = "ENA_PMU_INT is a PMU raw interrupt enable register.

Bit assignment identical to RAW_PMU_INT. Linux hix5hd2_gmac.c writes 0 at init (all disabled), vendor U-Boot writes 0 (~RAW_INT_ALL_MASK).

Data sheet 5.7 ENA_PMU_INT (offset 0x5C4, printed page 5-87, `Hi3516AV200-Datasheet.txt` line 34668).
Hi3516 V100 data sheet (Chinese original) 5.6 ENA_PMU_INT (offset 0x5C4, printed page 5-99, `Hi3516-Datasheet.txt` line 33843).";

